//     iBsu1147_modify.xml (the repaired Bacillus model, previously missing)
//     and mbt212871-sup-0003-AppendixS3.xml (the Pichia supplementary model,
//     previously unlocated). Every cached checkpoint in the markdown tables
//     (Tables 4, 8, 9: max growth, viability threshold, minimum viable O2,
//     growth/CO2 there; the 0.0035/0.0016/0.0050 combined-flux anchors)
//     reproduces to 4 decimal places. The combined-production sweep
//     faithfully reproduces one upstream bug: cell 32/25/33 of the
//     Yeast/Pichia/Bacillus notebooks builds the reference nanobody's amino-
//     acid composition from GFP_SEQ instead of NANOBODY_SEQ -- kept as-is
//     because it's what actually produced the published 0.0035/0.0016/0.0050
//     numbers being matched; it affects only this reference curve, not the
//     Nb14/Nb1_gbHSV construct figures below.
